      "3. Shape the buffer to (1, 30, 17) float32, axis 1 ordered oldest -> newest.",
      "4. Run the graph -> (1, 3) logits.",
      "5. probabilities = softmax(logits); stage = output.class_labels[argmax(logits)]."
